      "updated": 1770000000000,
      "link": "https://github.com/williamowen65/atlas-the-public-think-tank/blob/AppStartupAndWiring_visualization/src/Atlas.Console/Program.cs",
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Domain projects define the ports:\n• Graph owns INodeRepository and INodeTypeRepository.\n• Content owns IDocumentRepository.\n• Participants owns IParticipantRepository.\n\nConsole supplies the current adapters:\n• JsonNodeRepository → nodes.json\n• JsonNodeTypeRepository → node-types.json\n• JsonDocumentRepository → documents.json\n• JsonParticipantRepository → participants.json\n\nMeaning: Program.cs is the composition root. It chooses infrastructure and connects boundaries without moving domain ownership into Console.",
      "rawText": "Domain projects define the ports:\n• Graph owns INodeRepository and INodeTypeRepository.\n• Content owns IDocumentRepository.\n• Participants owns IParticipantRepository.\n\nConsole supplies the current adapters:\n• JsonNodeRepository → nodes.json\n• JsonNodeTypeRepository → node-types.json\n• JsonDocumentRepository → documents.json\n• JsonParticipantRepository → participants.json\n\nMeaning: Program.cs is the composition root. It chooses infrastructure and connects boundaries without moving domain ownership into Console.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Domain projects define the ports:\n• Graph owns INodeRepository and INodeTypeRepository.\n• Content owns IDocumentRepository.\n• Participants owns IParticipantRepository.\n\nConsole supplies the current adapters:\n• JsonNodeRepository → nodes.json\n• JsonNodeTypeRepository → node-types.json\n• JsonDocumentRepository → documents.json\n• JsonParticipantRepository → participants.json\n\nMeaning: Program.cs is the composition root. It chooses infrastructure and connects boundaries without moving domain ownership into Console.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
