      "updated": 1770000000000,
      "link": "https://github.com/williamowen65/atlas-the-public-think-tank/blob/AppStartupAndWiring_visualization/src/Atlas.Console/Eventing/InMemoryEventPublisher.cs",
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "InMemoryEventPublisher is created once at startup.\n\nInternal shape:\nDictionary<Type, List<Action<object>>>\n\nRegistration performed by Program.cs:\n• NodeCreatedV1 → ObserveNodeLifecycleInContent.Handle(NodeCreatedV1)\n• NodeArchivedV1 → ObserveNodeLifecycleInContent.Handle(NodeArchivedV1)\n\nNo handlers are registered for:\n• NodeRestoredV1\n• NodeParentAttachedV1\n• NodeParentDetachedV1\n\nDispatch behavior:\n• Exact runtime event type selects the handler list.\n• Zero subscribers is safe and logged.\n• All matching handlers run synchronously in registration order.\n• The publisher is host infrastructure; Graph records event facts but does not know the bus or its subscribers.",
      "rawText": "InMemoryEventPublisher is created once at startup.\n\nInternal shape:\nDictionary<Type, List<Action<object>>>\n\nRegistration performed by Program.cs:\n• NodeCreatedV1 → ObserveNodeLifecycleInContent.Handle(NodeCreatedV1)\n• NodeArchivedV1 → ObserveNodeLifecycleInContent.Handle(NodeArchivedV1)\n\nNo handlers are registered for:\n• NodeRestoredV1\n• NodeParentAttachedV1\n• NodeParentDetachedV1\n\nDispatch behavior:\n• Exact runtime event type selects the handler list.\n• Zero subscribers is safe and logged.\n• All matching handlers run synchronously in registration order.\n• The publisher is host infrastructure; Graph records event facts but does not know the bus or its subscribers.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "InMemoryEventPublisher is created once at startup.\n\nInternal shape:\nDictionary<Type, List<Action<object>>>\n\nRegistration performed by Program.cs:\n• NodeCreatedV1 → ObserveNodeLifecycleInContent.Handle(NodeCreatedV1)\n• NodeArchivedV1 → ObserveNodeLifecycleInContent.Handle(NodeArchivedV1)\n\nNo handlers are registered for:\n• NodeRestoredV1\n• NodeParentAttachedV1\n• NodeParentDetachedV1\n\nDispatch behavior:\n• Exact runtime event type selects the handler list.\n• Zero subscribers is safe and logged.\n• All matching handlers run synchronously in registration order.\n• The publisher is host infrastructure; Graph records event facts but does not know the bus or its subscribers.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
