      "updated": 1770000000000,
      "link": "https://github.com/williamowen65/atlas-the-public-think-tank/blob/AppStartupAndWiring_visualization/src/Atlas.Console/NodeCreationWorkflow.cs",
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Startup only registers subscribers. Publication occurs later inside a host-coordinated command.\n\nTypical node workflow:\n1. Graph behavior creates or mutates a Node and records event object(s) on Node.DomainEvents.\n2. Console saves the updated Node through INodeRepository.\n3. Console iterates the recorded events.\n4. InMemoryEventPublisher.Publish(event) dispatches synchronously.\n5. Registered Content observer receives NodeCreatedV1 or NodeArchivedV1.\n6. Observer queries IDocumentRepository and confirms the referenced description document exists.\n7. Console clears the node’s recorded events after dispatch.\n\nImportant:\n• Save occurs before publish in the demonstrated workflows.\n• The Content observer currently validates/logs; it does not create or change a Document.\n• Parent/restore events publish safely but currently report no subscribers.",
      "rawText": "Startup only registers subscribers. Publication occurs later inside a host-coordinated command.\n\nTypical node workflow:\n1. Graph behavior creates or mutates a Node and records event object(s) on Node.DomainEvents.\n2. Console saves the updated Node through INodeRepository.\n3. Console iterates the recorded events.\n4. InMemoryEventPublisher.Publish(event) dispatches synchronously.\n5. Registered Content observer receives NodeCreatedV1 or NodeArchivedV1.\n6. Observer queries IDocumentRepository and confirms the referenced description document exists.\n7. Console clears the node’s recorded events after dispatch.\n\nImportant:\n• Save occurs before publish in the demonstrated workflows.\n• The Content observer currently validates/logs; it does not create or change a Document.\n• Parent/restore events publish safely but currently report no subscribers.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Startup only registers subscribers. Publication occurs later inside a host-coordinated command.\n\nTypical node workflow:\n1. Graph behavior creates or mutates a Node and records event object(s) on Node.DomainEvents.\n2. Console saves the updated Node through INodeRepository.\n3. Console iterates the recorded events.\n4. InMemoryEventPublisher.Publish(event) dispatches synchronously.\n5. Registered Content observer receives NodeCreatedV1 or NodeArchivedV1.\n6. Observer queries IDocumentRepository and confirms the referenced description document exists.\n7. Console clears the node’s recorded events after dispatch.\n\nImportant:\n• Save occurs before publish in the demonstrated workflows.\n• The Content observer currently validates/logs; it does not create or change a Document.\n• Parent/restore events publish safely but currently report no subscribers.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
