      "updated": 1770000000000,
      "link": "https://github.com/williamowen65/atlas-the-public-think-tank/blob/AppStartupAndWiring_visualization/src/Atlas.Console/ConsoleApplication.cs",
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "ConsoleApplication receives all constructed dependencies through its constructor and stores them for the menu workflows.\n\nIt becomes the current host coordinator for:\n• participant selection/creation/browsing\n• node creation/browsing/mutation\n• node-type listing/creation\n• cross-boundary display composition\n• event publication after relevant saves\n• displaying the underlying JSON files\n\nThe current participant begins as “Legacy Console User” unless another participant is selected or created.\n\nThe object graph is assembled manually. There is no dependency-injection container, web request scope, background worker, or externally configured service registry.",
      "rawText": "ConsoleApplication receives all constructed dependencies through its constructor and stores them for the menu workflows.\n\nIt becomes the current host coordinator for:\n• participant selection/creation/browsing\n• node creation/browsing/mutation\n• node-type listing/creation\n• cross-boundary display composition\n• event publication after relevant saves\n• displaying the underlying JSON files\n\nThe current participant begins as “Legacy Console User” unless another participant is selected or created.\n\nThe object graph is assembled manually. There is no dependency-injection container, web request scope, background worker, or externally configured service registry.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ConsoleApplication receives all constructed dependencies through its constructor and stores them for the menu workflows.\n\nIt becomes the current host coordinator for:\n• participant selection/creation/browsing\n• node creation/browsing/mutation\n• node-type listing/creation\n• cross-boundary display composition\n• event publication after relevant saves\n• displaying the underlying JSON files\n\nThe current participant begins as “Legacy Console User” unless another participant is selected or created.\n\nThe object graph is assembled manually. There is no dependency-injection container, web request scope, background worker, or externally configured service registry.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
