      "updated": 1770000000000,
      "link": "https://github.com/williamowen65/atlas-the-public-think-tank/blob/AppStartupAndWiring_visualization/docs/architecture/CONTEXT-MAP.md",
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Possible decisions before polishing this visualization:\n• Show startup as one numbered vertical workflow or as an object graph?\n• Separate “construct object” from “load/migrate data”?\n• Treat seeding as startup policy, Graph application behavior, or temporary Console behavior?\n• Should Content’s observer live in Content, in the host, or be renamed to show that it is host-owned?\n• Which recorded Graph facts are domain events versus public integration events?\n• Should handler failure stop the command, be isolated, or be retried?\n• Which application services should replace direct repository orchestration in a web host?\n• Which startup steps are current evidence versus intended long-term architecture?",
      "rawText": "Possible decisions before polishing this visualization:\n• Show startup as one numbered vertical workflow or as an object graph?\n• Separate “construct object” from “load/migrate data”?\n• Treat seeding as startup policy, Graph application behavior, or temporary Console behavior?\n• Should Content’s observer live in Content, in the host, or be renamed to show that it is host-owned?\n• Which recorded Graph facts are domain events versus public integration events?\n• Should handler failure stop the command, be isolated, or be retried?\n• Which application services should replace direct repository orchestration in a web host?\n• Which startup steps are current evidence versus intended long-term architecture?",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Possible decisions before polishing this visualization:\n• Show startup as one numbered vertical workflow or as an object graph?\n• Separate “construct object” from “load/migrate data”?\n• Treat seeding as startup policy, Graph application behavior, or temporary Console behavior?\n• Should Content’s observer live in Content, in the host, or be renamed to show that it is host-owned?\n• Which recorded Graph facts are domain events versus public integration events?\n• Should handler failure stop the command, be isolated, or be retried?\n• Which application services should replace direct repository orchestration in a web host?\n• Which startup steps are current evidence versus intended long-term architecture?",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
